    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dōlĭārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of a cask</i> or <i>casks.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">DOLEARIA OFFICINA,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4888</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dōlĭārĭ-um</span></b> ,
				ii, n., <i>the place
				where wine-casks are kept;</i> corresp. to our <i>wine-cellar</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 18, 1, 35, § 7</span></i>. 
			</div>
